                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/2983: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-15T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1919,
                                4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your March 15, midnight.</p>
                <p>Report essential facts by cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
